        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_974_2947.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">früntlich</unclear> willig dienst, unnd was wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eern</unclear>
<lb n="2"/>liebs und guots vermögen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sygen</unclear> üch jederzeit zuovor, für-
<lb n="3"/>sichtigen, ersamen, wysen, besonder lieben unnd guotten
<lb n="4"/>fründt, Was unnser verordnete pfleger der armen
<lb n="5"/>in unnserm spittal, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anderer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">aembter</unclear>, von wegen
<lb n="6"/>wylund unnsrer hindersässin, Jungfrow <persName resp="#ner">Madlena
<lb n="7"/>Koblerin</persName> saeligen ufgerichten testaments, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">letsten</unclear>
<lb n="8"/>willens, an unns <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">suppliciert</unclear>, das haben ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uß</unclear> in-
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verwartter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abgeschrifft</unclear> zuovernemen, wir auch dar-
<lb n="10"/>über by unnsern lieben mittrathsfründen, <persName resp="#ner">Niclaus
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gallen</unclear></persName>, unnd siner ußgesezten kinder vogt, <persName resp="#ner">Hannsen
<lb n="12"/>von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Maulishouen</unclear></persName>, auch <persName resp="#ner">Hanns Jerg Kellern</persName> ermelts
<lb n="13"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Gallen</placeName> dochterman bericht ingenomen, warumb sich
<lb n="14"/>die sach <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bißher</unclear> verhindert, das erstgemelter Jungfrow
<lb n="15"/><persName resp="#ner">Madlena <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Koblerin</unclear></persName> letster will nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vollstreckht</unclear>
<lb n="16"/>worden, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">do</unclear> befinden wir erstlich by <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ermeltem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gallen</unclear>
<lb n="17"/>disen bericht, das er jederzeit erbuettig gewesen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear>
<lb n="18"/>noch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">souil</unclear> an ime solchem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">siner</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geschwigen</unclear> Jung-
<lb n="19"/>frow Madlenen letsten willen statt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zethuon</unclear>,
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">souer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">söllichs</unclear> von <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">andern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sinen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schwaegern</unclear> den
<lb n="21"/>Koblern üwern <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">burgern</unclear> auch beschehe, Demnach
<lb n="22"/>berichten uns obgemelte <persName resp="#ner">Hanns von Mauliß-
<lb n="23"/>houen</persName> unnd <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Hanns</unclear> Jerg <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Keller</unclear></persName>, das sy verschiner
<lb n="24"/>tagen, üwern burger <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Michel</unclear> Koblern</persName>, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">desselben</unclear>
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geschwigen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wylund</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Bartlome</unclear> Koblers</persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sälgen</unclear>
<lb n="26"/>wittwen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hierumben</unclear> durch ain schryben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">früntlich</unclear>
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ersuochen</unclear> lassen, das sy offtermelter Jungfrow
<lb n="28"/>Madlenen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">saeligen</unclear> testament auch nachsehen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wöllindt</unclear>,
<lb n="29"/>damit ir letster will <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">volstrekht</unclear> werde, syge aber
<lb n="30"/>inen über solches nit allain kain antwurt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eruolgt</unclear>.
<lb n="31"/>sonnder <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuogehoertes</unclear> schryben zum <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">andern</unclear> mal wider-
<lb n="32"/>umb unnd zum thail eroëffnet zuogeschickht worden.
<lb n="33"/>darab sy dann nit wenig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">befrömbdens</unclear> tragen,
<lb n="34"/>unnd sich dessen nit söllen versehen. derwegen
<lb n="35"/>sy unns mitsampt obermelten unnsern pflegern
<lb n="36"/>der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">armen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glychsfals</unclear> umb hilff und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürderung</unclear>
<lb n="37"/>an üch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ersuocht</unclear>, unnd gebetten, damit ir
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_974_2948.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">von</unclear> oberkaitt wegen, die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Euern</unclear> auch dahin <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wijßten</unclear>,
<lb n="39"/>das <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sij</unclear> vilgemelter <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Jungfrau</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Koblerin</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">säliger</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uffge</unclear>-
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">richtem</unclear> testament volg. unnd statt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thuegindt</unclear> etc.
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Diewijl</unclear> nun dem also. Gelanngt derhalben an
<lb n="42"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Euch</unclear> unnser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachburlich</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundtlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begärrn</unclear>,
<lb n="43"/>Ir wellendt mit den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Euern</unclear> verschaffen, das <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sij</unclear>
<lb n="44"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">od</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Jemanndts</unclear> von <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Iretwegen</unclear> mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">volkommen</unclear>
<lb n="45"/>gewalt, uff nechstkomenden <date resp="#ner">sambstag den zwen
<lb n="46"/>unnd zwaintzigisten tag diß Monats Novembris</date>.
<lb n="47"/>alher <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erschinen</unclear>, unnd vilgemelter <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jungfrau</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Koblerin</unclear></persName>
<lb n="48"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sälger</unclear> testament <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anheren</unclear>, unnd vollgendts dem-
<lb n="49"/>selbigen statt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thuen</unclear> wellind. Damit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ainem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jeden</unclear>
<lb n="50"/>was <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Im</unclear> nach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lut</unclear> deß testaments gebürt ver-
<lb n="51"/>folgt, und vilgedachter <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jungfrau</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Madlenen</unclear></persName>
<lb n="52"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">letster</unclear> will, wie billich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">volltstreckht</unclear> werden möge,
<lb n="53"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pitten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Euch</unclear> unns hierüber <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bij</unclear> disem unnserm
<lb n="54"/>potten. widerumb schrifftliche <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">antwurtt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuokomen</unclear>
<lb n="55"/>zelaßen, Das begeren wir umb Euch hinwider-
<lb n="56"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachbürlichen</unclear> unnd
<lb n="57"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründtlichen</unclear>.
<lb n="58"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">umb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuverglijchen</unclear>, unnd zuverdienen, Datum
<lb n="59"/>den. <origDate when="1572-11-18" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">18ten</unclear> Novembris anno etc. 72</origDate>.
<lb n="60"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Verwallter</unclear> der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hauptmanschaft</unclear>
<lb n="61"/>auch <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-56" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermaister <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear> Rath
<lb n="62"/>der statt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Costanntz</unclear></orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_974_2949.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="63"/>Herr Verwalter der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">haubtmannschafft</unclear> Herr Burger=
<lb n="64"/>maister, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Edle</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vest</unclear>, fuersichtig, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ersam</unclear>, weis, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sonders</unclear>
<lb n="65"/>guenstige herrenn, wir seijenn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frembdenng</unclear>
<lb n="66"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">halb</unclear> bericht, das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weijlennd</unclear> die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tugentsam</unclear>
<lb n="67"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Junckfrow</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Madlena <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Kolerin</unclear></persName>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ew</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">h</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">u</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wht</unclear>
<lb n="68"/>gewesne <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Innsaeßin</unclear> saelig, Inn Irem testament
<lb n="69"/>unnd letstenn <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">willenn</unclear>, den Armen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">duerfftig</unclear>
<lb n="70"/>im <orgName resp="#ner">Spittal</orgName>, derglichenn den Armen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bilgeren</unclear>
<lb n="71"/>Inn dem <orgName resp="#ner">Seelhaus</orgName> allhie, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">voegennckli</unclear> der
<lb n="72"/><placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Alhaite</unclear></placeName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuerhalttung</unclear> der Armenn, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> den
<lb n="73"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Suendarsiechenn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zur</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Innrenn</unclear> Pfannenn, ain
<lb n="74"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">suma</unclear> gelts verordnet, wie dann <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dasselbig</unclear>
<lb n="75"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ew</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">h</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">u</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">w</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alls</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Irer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">danckhaeyt</unclear>, unnd vor
<lb n="76"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dennen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ernannt</unclear> testament, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ordennlicher</unclear>
<lb n="77"/>weis <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">aufgericht</unclear>, Inn guetem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wissenn</unclear>
<lb n="78"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dweil</unclear> unnd aber auf den <date resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dreijzechennde</unclear> tag
<lb n="79"/>kuenfftigenn monnats <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Currennis</unclear></date>, ain
<lb n="80"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gannz</unclear> Jar <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erloeffenn</unclear> wirt, das
<lb n="81"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermeltte</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ew</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">h</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">u</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">w</unclear>. gewesne Inn=
<lb n="82"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">saeßin</unclear> Inn Gott <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verstorben</unclear>, aber unns
<lb n="83"/>alls Pflegern <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gedachter</unclear> vier <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Aembter</unclear>, von
<lb n="84"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Irenn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Erben</unclear>, dz Jhenig, so <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verschaffnet</unclear>,
<lb n="85"/>unnd legiert worden, nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erlegt</unclear>, noch ouch
<lb n="86"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wissenn</unclear> moegenn, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wer</unclear> unns <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dasselbig</unclear>
<lb n="87"/>zuestellenn <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wuert</unclear>, wir aber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnserer</unclear>
<lb n="88"/>pflichtenn nach schuldig, das Jhenig so den
<lb n="89"/>Armen gehoert, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> nutz <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">derselben</unclear>, unnd
<lb n="90"/>damit ouch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dr</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Junckfrow</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">testiererin</unclear> saelig
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_974_2950.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="91"/>willenn. wie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sy</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">im</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">selbß</unclear> billich. statt
<lb n="92"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geschehe</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuouvermenndenn</unclear>. So ist an E. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">V</unclear>. F.
<lb n="93"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">W</unclear>. unnser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnderdiennstlichs</unclear> bittenn, die
<lb n="94"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">welle</unclear> den armen zuo guotem, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> umb
<lb n="95"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">souil</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">durch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jre</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gschrifft</unclear>, oder inn annder
<lb n="96"/>weg <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bij</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Innen</unclear>. so <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ir</unclear> Jungfraw <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Tästier</unclear>-
<lb n="97"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">rerin</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">säligenn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verlaßennshafft</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnder</unclear>-
<lb n="98"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hanndenn</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gewogenn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürdersam</unclear>
<lb n="99"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sin</unclear>. Damit gedachte legata <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vnns</unclear>
<lb n="100"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuogestelt</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> wir der Jungfraw
<lb n="101"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Tästierrerin</unclear> willenn, gegenn den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">armen</unclear>.
<lb n="102"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">exequieren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">volstreckenn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mögnndt</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Daß</unclear>
<lb n="103"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">begerenn</unclear> wir umb <persName role="recipient" resp="#ner">E. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">V</unclear>. F. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">W</unclear>.</persName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nebet</unclear>
<lb n="104"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dem</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sij</unclear> dardurch ain werck der
<lb n="105"/>barmhertzigkait gegenn den armen
<lb n="106"/>erzaigt. unnd die belonung dardurch.
<lb n="107"/>von Gott dem allmechtigenn, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gewüßlich</unclear>
<lb n="108"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuoempfachen</unclear> hat, ganntz <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">diennstlichenn</unclear>
<lb n="109"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuouerdiennen</unclear> etc.
<lb n="110"/>E. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">V</unclear>. F. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">W</unclear>.
<lb n="111"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verordnette</unclear> pfleger
<lb n="112"/>der armen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">im</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-552" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">grooßen</unclear>
<lb n="113"/>Spittal</orgName>.
<lb n="114"/>deß <orgName role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gozhaußes</unclear></orgName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <orgName role="issuer" resp="#ner">armen
<lb n="115"/>Bilgern</orgName>.
<lb n="116"/>der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Laitr</unclear> deß <orgName role="issuer" resp="#ner">Allmuosens</orgName>.
<lb n="117"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deß</unclear> <orgName role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Siechennhaußes</unclear></orgName> zuo <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">der</unclear>
<lb n="118"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-470" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Jnneren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Thannen</unclear></placeName>.
